sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Let CSMS trigger a request for swapping batteries

    CSMS->>CS: RequestBatterySwapRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: requestId must be <not omitted><br>idToken.idToken must be <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken>

    CS-->>CSMS: RequestBatterySwapResponse (status = Rejected, statusInfo.reasonCode = NoBatteryAvailable)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
